{{#> layout-en}}
<p>{{> salutation-en}}</p>
<p>A new request was submitted: <strong>{{typeName}}</strong> ({{featureName}}).</p>
{{> button url=requestUrl label="Open request"}}
<p style="font-size:12px;color:#888">{{requestUrl}}</p>
<p>This e-mail contains no attachment and no sample content. The anonymized sample is available in the portal after you sign in.</p>
<p>{{> signature-en}}</p>
{{/layout-en}}
